---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../config/brand';
---

<Layout title={`Fact-Checking & Sourcing Policy — ${BRAND.name}`} description={`How facts, technical claims, and sources are verified on ${BRAND.name}.`}>
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-white/10 py-14 sm:py-16">
    <!-- Ambient Backdrop Light -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-10 left-1/4 w-96 h-64 bg-emerald-500/[0.08] dark:bg-emerald-500/[0.1] rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs font-semibold mb-4 backdrop-blur-xs">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
        <span>Integrity First Policy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Sourcing & Fact-Checking Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        On {BRAND.name}, every claim, benchmark, and code example is verified against primary authoritative sources.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-6">
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#15131b] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-white/10 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] dark:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] space-y-2">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Primary Sources Only</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        We do not rely on second-hand summaries or unverified social media claims. All technical sourcing comes directly from official documentation (e.g. Python, Docker, Qiskit), peer-reviewed research papers (arXiv, IEEE, NeurIPS), or official legislative gazettes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#15131b] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-white/10 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] dark:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] space-y-3">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Last-Verified Dates & Confidence Badges</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Every guide displays the exact date of verification along with a confidence rating:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li><strong>High Confidence:</strong> Settled theoretical fundamentals or verified official API standards.</li>
        <li><strong>Medium Confidence:</strong> Rapidly evolving toolchains with active migrations in progress.</li>
        <li><strong>Evolving:</strong> Active policy debates or preview technologies (e.g., bleeding-edge AI models).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#15131b] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-white/10 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] dark:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] space-y-2">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Neutrality on Policy & Macroeconomics</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        On policy, economic, and geopolitical topics, analysis remains strictly non-partisan. Clear distinctions are made between empirical facts and analytical hypotheses, citing statutory text and data tables without political slant.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#15131b] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-white/10 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] dark:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] space-y-2">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Link Integrity Checks</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Our automated CI build steps execute continuous link validation and route verification, ensuring zero broken links or unresolved citations exist across the platform.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
